{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":64790,\"title\":\"For Sarah\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"After his alcohol-fuelled 18th birthday party, Cédric gets into a spectacular car crash as he drives home with his 17-year-old childhood friend, Sarah. That night, the two teens and their parents see their worlds turn upside down. The accident sets both families on a long and tortuous path they didn’t expect.\\n\\nThe tragedy forces them all to dig deep inside themselves as they struggle to survive and even grow stronger, through a series of medical, legal and emotional challenges. Their story is rooted in a quest for truth, as they try to come to grips with what really happened on that fateful night, and how these kids are dealing with it.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dGfgwWkZKU9WX7sHpfK6f3v9HQo.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nL5rWQRquSCs5BwZouk8wL9v6Hc.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":2,\"year\":2015,\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":10,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"TVA\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"CA\",\"name\":\"Canada\"},{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2015-11-30\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":130358,\"name\":\"Éric Tessier\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/a9v9RJNvsFHN7zIuExitpEVMezK.jpg\"},{\"id\":1553689,\"name\":\"Félix-Antoine Duval\",\"character\":\"Cédric Dutil\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/15Q69Dz9Aq9YOdNIKJWWeIhmuB8.jpg\"},{\"id\":1554108,\"name\":\"Guillaume Gauthier\",\"character\":\"Gégé\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lZLamjYsqbHlUbj9WIEJZILRtPO.jpg\"},{\"id\":1554110,\"name\":\"Romane Denis\",\"character\":\"Lola\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oUEuOOMHuRaEIimk5YVKfqwciDM.jpg\"},{\"id\":79606,\"name\":\"Marianne Fortier\",\"character\":\"Sarah Vaillancourt\"